    "rationale": "The brief gives counterbore size and depth directly as numbers, so no additional fastener assumption is needed beyond using the stated dimensions.",
    "consequence_if_wrong": "If a different fastener head size was intended, the counterbore may not seat the actual screw used, though the stated dimensions themselves are still built as specified.",
    "reversible": true,
    "approved": false
